{"title":"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/2014703fb14513dea552778050017f01847222e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-3x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/8526d21347b0796c64bbb8b2e929ab0f11a4e8db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40d5932d14e9669972339c9f28bbe1bab013d5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 2^{2} - 3 \\times 2^{2} = 4 \\times 4 - 3 \\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666ae8724b6c804f6b4763cc7676fdd2d3c0ce13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16 - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc527d097c830651249e4f2414ed489f596eb4af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c3e1f31859a15251277dbe26861a37cb6c2a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{2} - 3x^{2} = x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into this, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/426485cfa12136351eb073708422ebf843447c13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} = 2^{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat\">2024 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" ti